# SMS opt-in compliance (ALGR)

When creating or updating **SMS opt-in / Twilio TFV consent** pages or copy for any Labs product, use the shared compliance template. Consent structure stays identical; only placeholders (app name, emails, URLs, sample flavor) change.

## Canon

Playbook: `docs/prompts/sms-opt-in-compliance.md` (synced from ALGR scrap).

Hard rules:

1. **VIA_TEXT** primary consent (`START` / `Y`) — do not make a website checkbox the primary opt-in method.
2. Do **not** narrow the six TFV use-case categories.
3. Program is **transactional/service only** — no marketing SMS under this consent.
4. Keep product pages congruent with the approved Labs TFV use cases.

Pairs with `legal-tos` (account Terms/consent); SMS opt-in remains a separate surface.
